# DOES THE ABI TABLE POINT AT CODE THAT EXISTS? Six of aot_helpers.def's
# DELEGATES TO citations ended up past the end of files that Phases 3-5 shrank.
# source-citations.py says what this can and cannot catch, and FrameEnds.def
# (nine exit paths, three hooked; the escape self-test static_asserts its
# shape) gets the same check for the one class of rot a machine can see.
#
